{
  "name": "pi-multi-account",
  "version": "1.20.0",
  "description": "Automatic multi-account failover & rotation for Pi Agent across Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI/ChatGPT Codex, Google Antigravity, Kimi For Coding, Cursor, Qwen/Alibaba, and Ollama. Auto-discovers authenticated accounts, grows the rotation on login, and drops accounts on logout, expiry, or quota/rate-limit errors",
